# http://tankafett.biz/?do=hublist&get=hublist.xml.bz2  (timeout / not a bz2 hublist, 2026-09)
# http://www.hublista.hu/hublist.xml.bz2
# http://publichublist.com/?do=hublist.xml.bz2
# http://openhublist.org

X http://gwebcache.spearforensics.com/
X http://www.myfoxy.net/gwc/cgi-bin/fc
X http://gwc.gofoxy.net:2108/gwc/cgi-bin/fc

# Kad nodes.dat is NOT listed here: DefaultServices has no nodes.dat type yet,
# HostCache::ImportNodes currently accepts nodes.dat new-format version 1 only,
# and Kad2 remains partial (#86 / #160). Do not advertise Kad as complete.
#
# ADC/ADCS hub protocol is not implemented (#163). Hublists may mix NMDC and
# ADC; import already skips adc:// and adcs://.
#
# Keep at least four gwebcache links and one link to a .met/hublist file
# or they'll keep getting added every time they're removed
#
# Delete this file and Envy will use internal defaults.
#
# Network status: crawler.doxu.org
# Cache status: gwebcaches.pongwar.com or cache.trillinux.org/crawler
# Test: http://cache.getenvy.com/cachechu/?get=1&net=gnutella2&client=TEST1.0
# Latest version at http://sourceforge.net/p/getenvy/code/HEAD/tree/trunk/Data/DefaultServices.dat
#
# Last updated September 2026 (DC hublist URLs only)
